Z||000000||mrfixit58||07-15-2000||09:02 AM||||I spoke with the president of the Suncoast Fiero Club. He said that there is a car show (all makes, not just Fiero) planned for tomorrow at the St. Pete pier. Registration is from 6 am till 11 am. I'm planning on attending (not showing) and was hoping some of you guys who are local to the Tampa/St.Pete area could make it. He said that there were only going to be about 6-7 Fieros but it would be a great time to meet some other Fiero people.<P>Hope to see ya there,<BR>Roy||||reg||10
